# Betelgeuse environment manifest
#
# World law (RUN.md, 2026-10-22): every repository declares the environment
# variables its business needs in this file. This is the declaration; it is
# tracked in git and reviewed with the code.
#
# Values here are placeholders. Secret-looking keys stay empty: real secrets
# live in the project secret store (DeployDock project secrets), never in git.
#
# Generated by `env envfile generate` from the code that reads these names (2026-11-24).
# Re-run it after changing configuration. `env envfile check` gates drift.

# --- Runtime ---
# config; read in tools/server/tests/conftest.py, tools/server/tests/utils.py
PORT=

# --- Secrets ---
# secret — set in the project secret store; read in tools/ui/tests/stories/fixtures/api-docs.ts
